# TwinleafTown — Platinum-exact layout
# Shapes derived from the Platinum layout; tiles are Emerald General/Mauville metatiles.
# Legend: T tree . grass , tall grass = path ~ water L/</> ledges F fence b flower bed
#         S sign/mailbox W walk-in exit warp; letters = building doors (@stamp)
@compiler platinum
@name TwinleafTown
@layout LAYOUT_TWINLEAF_TOWN
@width 32
@height 32
@primary gTileset_General
@secondary gTileset_Mauville
@connection up MAP_ROUTE201 0
@stamp B GEN_HOUSE5T MAP_TWINLEAF_TOWN_PLAYERSHOUSE_1F 0
@stamp A MAUVILLE_HOUSE5T MAP_TWINLEAF_TOWN_RIVALSHOUSE_1F 0
@stamp C VERDANTURF_HOUSE4 MAP_TWINLEAF_TOWN_HOUSE1 0
@stamp D GEN_HOUSE4 MAP_TWINLEAF_TOWN_HOUSE2 0
@sign TwinleafTown_EventScript_RivalsHouseSign
@sign TwinleafTown_EventScript_TownSign
@sign TwinleafTown_EventScript_PlayersHouseSign
@grid
